<title>FRANCE: Axa-UAP placing 1.8 mln Scor shares - brokers.</title>
<headline>Axa-UAP placing 1.8 mln Scor shares - brokers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer Axa-UAP was placing 1.8 million shares of reinsurance group Scor at 193 francs each on the market, French brokers said on Friday.</p>
<p>Axa-UAP was also placing 509,000 Scor convertible bonds at 824 francs each, they said.  </p>
<p>Axa-UAP later confirmed the transaction which concerns its entire equity stake in Scor.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
